    "moving-content": {
      "state": "present",
      "evidence": "CORE-05 (2026-11-23): the preview moves while a playing runs. It starts only on Play (never by itself), Pause stops it, and nothing moves while still, a picture that arrives late included (drawn once, then the same pixels): the journeys the-preview-draws, the-preview-plays, the-preview-shows-the-picture and the-preview-is-still (2.2.2)."
